Package: nbzinbPate
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Brandon", "Pate", , "patebd2@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively
    reweighted least squares (IRLS) for the regression coefficients,
    alternated with Newton-Raphson for the log dispersion parameter, and
    zero-inflated negative binomial (ZINB) regression by an EM algorithm
    whose M-steps are weighted IRLS fits. Standard errors for the ZINB
    model come from an analytic Hessian of the observed-data
    log-likelihood. No general-purpose optimizer is used.
